sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Cloud Scheduler
    participant D as Discovery job
    participant G as e-GP
    participant B as Cloud Storage
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant E as Enrichment job
    participant AI as Gemini
    participant X as Email service

    rect rgb(240, 246, 252)
    Note over S,M: Discover new TORs (UC-34), hourly
    S->>D: start
    D->>M: mark stale runs failed, create IngestionRun (running)
    D->>G: search "ซอฟต์แวร์" and fetch project details
    loop each project
        D->>M: upsert Tor by projectCode, compare sourceContentHash
        alt created, changed, or no stored PDF
            D->>G: download TOR PDF
            D->>B: store PDF (never in Mongo)
        end
        alt unchanged
            Note right of D: nothing to queue
        else keyword gate fails
            D->>M: pipelineStatus = rejected
        else software-related title
            D->>M: enqueue EnrichmentJob (torId, hash)
        end
    end
    D->>M: close IngestionRun with counts, write SystemLog
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 252)
    Note over S,AI: Enrich with AI (UC-35), every 15 minutes
    S->>E: start
    E->>M: read the fairness thresholds
    loop until maxCalls or queue empty
        E->>M: claim next job under a lease (first claim creates the IngestionRun)
        E->>B: read the TOR PDF
        E->>AI: one multimodal call (PDF, metadata, thresholds)
        AI-->>E: classification, summary, category, fairness signals
        E->>E: pre-filter signals against the TOR's own numbers, add data points
        alt software-related
            E->>M: save aiSummary and fairnessFlags, pipelineStatus = enriched
        else not software
            E->>M: pipelineStatus = rejected
        end
        Note right of E: on error the job retries with backoff, then is marked failed
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 244)
    Note over E,X: Refresh and notify (UC-37, UC-36)
    E->>G: read procurement stage of the TORs just enriched
    E->>AI: read the bid deadline from the invitation PDF, if there is one (small call)
    E->>M: write procurement stage and deadline
    E->>M: match vendor profiles and saved searches, create notifications
    E->>X: send match digest emails
    end
